    ELSE IF `the date on which the question is asked` AT LEAST `the date on which the authorisation would (if not renewed) expire`
         THEN IF `s 570(3) the power may be renewed` EQUALS JUST TRUE
              THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "But if the authorisation is renewed the power may also be renewed" (the power was renewed with the authorisation)
              ELSE JUST TRUE
